#: source/concepts/sensors/pva.rst:7
msgid "Pose Velocity Acceleration (PVA) Sensor"
msgstr "位姿、速度与加速度（PVA）传感器"

#: source/concepts/sensors/pva.rst:9
msgid ""
"A :class:`~sensors.Pva` reads the ground-truth kinematic state of a frame. "
"Use it for privileged observations, state estimation, or control inputs that"
" require more than an inertial sensor measures. Use an :doc:`imu` when the "
"observation should follow accelerometer and gyroscope conventions."
msgstr ""
":class:`~sensors.Pva` "
"读取坐标系的运动学真值状态。它适用于特权观测、状态估计，以及需要比惯性传感器测量内容更多的控制输入。如果观测应遵循加速度计和陀螺仪的约定，请使用 "
":doc:`imu` 。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/pva.rst:13
msgid ""
"The sensor can attach directly to a rigid body or to a fixed child prim "
"beneath a rigid-body ancestor. In the latter case, Isaac Lab composes the "
"child's fixed transform with the configured sensor offset."
msgstr ""
"传感器可以直接附着到刚体，也可以附着到具有刚体祖先节点的固定子 prim。后一种情况下，Isaac Lab 会将子节点的固定变换与配置的传感器偏移组合。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/pva.rst:18
msgid "Measurement contract"
msgstr "测量约定"

#: source/concepts/sensors/pva.rst:20
msgid ""
"For ``E`` environments, every vector has shape ``(E, 3)``. The pose has "
"shape ``(E, 7)`` in ``(x, y, z, qx, qy, qz, qw)`` order."
msgstr ""
"对于 ``E`` 个环境，每个向量的形状为 ``(E, 3)`` 。位姿形状为 ``(E, 7)`` ，分量顺序为 ``(x, y, z, qx, "
"qy, qz, qw)`` 。"

