#: source/concepts/sensors/pva.rst:72
msgid ""
"Like the IMU, acceleration uses state from consecutive simulation updates. "
"Reset the scene and sensor state together at episode boundaries."
msgstr "与 IMU 一样，加速度使用连续仿真更新中的状态计算。请在回合边界同时重置场景和传感器状态。"

